## Summary of Key Decisions

1. ✅ **SN Tag Placement**: Tags FOLLOW terms (critical discovery)
2. ✅ **Punctuation Independence**: All punctuation separated consistently
3. ✅ **Text Preservation**: LCC → LCC with only boundary changes
4. ✅ **Character Variants**: Deferred to Phase 1.5 proposal
5. ✅ **Robustness**: Algorithm handles both separated and attached punctuation input

